						 <p>Hey hey, this is pretty neat.</p> <p>Considering how big a role the UIU plays in 3Ports, its nice to see a UIU GoI doc going over how they might handle the anomalous when the ball is in their court. On top of that, the nods to all the various bits of the 3Ports canon made the city really come alive to me as a reader.</p> <p>+1. Job well done.</p> 
